; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Guarani / Avañe'ẽ (gn)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

mbohasa counter 5

launch_loop:
henoi_sistema counter
mbogue counter 1
mbojoja counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
mbohasa box 999
henoi_sistema box
